on (see 'Related Criteria And Research'). \par  \par Certain terms used in this report, particularly certain adjectives used to \par express our view on rating relevant factors, have specific meanings ascribed \par to them in our criteria, and should therefore be read in conjunction with such \par criteria. Please see Ratings Criteria at \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.standardandpoors.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.standardandpoors.com}}}\uc2 \f2  for further \par information. A description of each of S&P Global Ratings' rating categories is \par contained in "S&P Global Ratings Definitions" at \par \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.standardandpoors.com/en_US/web/guest/article/-/view/sourceId/504352"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.standardandpoors.com/en_US/web/guest/article/-/view/sourceId/504352}}}\uc2 \f2  \par Complete ratings information is available to subscribers of RatingsDirect at \par \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.capitaliq.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.capitaliq.com}}}\uc2 \f2 . All ratings affected by this rating action can be found on \par S&P Global Ratings' public website at \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.standardandpoors.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.standardandpoors.com}}}\uc2 \f2 . Use the \par Ratings search box located in the left column.  Alternatively, call one of the \par following S&P Global Ratings numbers: Client Support Europe (44) 20-7176-7176; \par London Press Office (44) 20-7176-3605; Paris (33) 1-4420-6708; Frankfurt (49) \par 69-33-999-225; or Stockholm (46) 8-440-5914 \par  \par Primary Credit Analyst: Ravi Bhatia, London +  44 20 7176 7113; \par                         ravi.bhatia@spglobal.com \par Secondary Contacts: Samira Mensah, Johannesburg +  27 11 214 4869; \par                     samira.mensah@spglobal.com \par                     Juili Pargaonkar, Dubai +971-4-372-7167; \par                     juili.pargaonkar@spglobal.com \par Additional Contact: Sovereign and 