\par\par \b \uc2 African Markets - Factors to watch on March 1\b0\par\par\uc2 395 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2017\par 05:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2017 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     NAIROBI, March 1(Reuters) - The following company announcements, scheduled economic\par indicators, debt and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market moves and political events may affect African markets on\par Wednesday.\par     - - - - -\par  GLOBAL MARKETS\par  U.S. stock futures and the dollar trimmed their gains on\par  Wednesday as U.S. President \f28 \uc2 \f2 Donald Trump\f28 \uc2 \f2  promised\par  immigration and tax reforms in a speech that contained few\par  specifics or surprises.                       \par  \par  WORLD OIL PRICES\par  U.S. crude lost more ground on Wednesday on rising U.S. oil\par  output, although \f28 \uc2 \f2 OPEC\f28 \uc2 \f2  production cuts continued to offer\par  support.                 \par  \par  EMERGING MARKETS\par  For the top emerging markets news, double click on\par             \par  \par  AFRICA STOCKS\par  For the latest news on African stocks, click on     \par  \par  \par  SOUTH AFRICA MARKETS\par  South Africa's rand weakened on Tuesday with emerging assets\par  struggling for clear direction as risk demand eased ahead of\par  a speech before Congress by U.S. President Donald\par  Trump.            \par  \par  \par  NIGERIA MARKETS\par  The Nigerian naira gained 2.2 percent to 450 per dollar on\par  the black market on Tuesday, a more than four-month high, a\par  day after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by selling dollars on\par  the interbank market, traders said.            \par  \par  \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 NIGERIA\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  ECONOMY\par  Nigeria's economy contracted 1.5 percent in 2016 due to\par  lower oil revenues and a shortage of hard \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the\par  National Bureau of Statistics said on Tuesday, its first\par  annual contraction in quarter of a century.            \par  \par  \par  KENYA MARKETS\par  The Kenyan shilling        held steady against the dollar on\par  Tuesday, with dollar inflows from horticultural produce\par  exporters and non-governmental organisations matching demand\par  from oil importers, traders said.            \par  \par  \par  KENYA AUTOS \par  General Motors Co        on Tuesday said it plans to sell\par  its majority ownership stake in \f28 \uc2 \f2 General Motors\f28 \uc2 \f2  East Africa\par  to its Japanese partner \f28 \uc2 \f2 Isuzu Motors Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2          , as the\par  U.S. carmaker continues to streamline by exiting non-core\par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .             \par  \par  \par  UGANDA MARKETRS\par  The Ugandan shilling        was unchanged on Tuesday and was\par  seen getting support from dollar inflows from\par  non-governmental organisations and coffee\par  exporters.                \par  \par  \par  IVORY COAST COCOA\par  Ivory Coast exported 139,746 tonnes of semi-finished cocoa\par  products between the start of the season on Oct. 1 and the\par  end of January, down 6.5 percent from a year earlier,\par  provisional port data showed on Tuesday.                 \par  \par  \par  \par  \par  \par      For the latest precious metals report click on        \par      For the latest base metals report click on         \par      For the latest crude oil report click on\f28 \par \par \par \par \uc2 Released: 2017-3-1T05:53:16.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020170301ed310050l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
