s president said on Tuesday he would seek re-election\par  next year and transform his coalition of small parties into\par  one party to shore up his power base, a move aimed at seeing\par  off another likely challenge by the opposition leader.\par                    \par  \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 NIGERIA CURRENCY\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Nigeria\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the interbank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign\par  exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market on Tuesday to help support the naira after\par  it hit an all-time low of 350 to the dollar in thin volume,\par  traders said.             \par  \par  NIGERIA BANKS\par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 Nigeria's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  this year is to allow banks to write\par  off bad loans for which they have already made provisions to\par  help them to clean up their balance sheets.\par      Pressure has been building on the country's banks, whose\par  loan books have been hit by Nigeria's shrinking economy,\par  plunging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  shortages following\par  the slump in oil prices.             \par  \par      For the latest precious metals report click on        \par      For the latest base metals report click on         \par      For the latest crude oil report click on\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-8-10T05:51:17.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160810ec8a0086h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
